":null,"text":"2.【二十】歲，天資消失，變成普通人。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:classical_text.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原文","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:classical_text.source","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"宋朝・王安石","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:classical_text.note_dots","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章中的「.」是表示斷詞的地方，朗讀時，不要把「同組的詞」分開。","n":32,"ssz":"....................1..........."},{"section":"served:classical_text.annotations[0].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還自揚州","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:classical_text.annotations[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.還自揚州：這個句子中的「還」意思是「回來」；「自」的解釋是「從」。配合後方的地名，整句翻譯成「從揚州回來」。","n":56,"ssz":"........1.1......2......................................"},{"section":"served:classical_text.annotations[1].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"泯然","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:classical_text.annotations[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.泯然：消失的樣子。","n":11,"ssz":".........1."},{"section":"served:word_matching.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、文白詞語比對","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:word_matching.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以下是原文與白話文的對照。請依照文意，寫出原文中灰底的白話文意思。","n":33,"ssz":"...............................2."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[0].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"金谿民方仲永，世隸耕。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[0].白話","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"金谿地方有一個人名叫方仲永，他們家(　)都以(　)為業。","n":28,"ssz":"......1....................."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[0].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"世代","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[0].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"種田","n":2,"ssz":"1."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[1].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"仲永生五年，未嘗識書具，忽啼求之","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[1].白話","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"仲永長到(　)時，(　)見過寫字的紙、筆，有一天，他(　)求要紙、筆。","n"